diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index 82eb178..4fdb98e 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@

 ## Unreleased

+- Let PassVoice opt in to an UP-only capture policy. Ignore DOWN and OK during capture, including a press released after the stop, and report a fresh press immediately after UP with the stopped session ID if its end notification is still pending. Other hosts keep their existing button behavior.
+
 - Validate the CW2017 cell voltage before accepting the first charge reading. When the gauge reports 0% with an invalid voltage, show an unavailable reading until the gauge recovers.

 - Request a 90–120 ms BLE connection interval after 20 seconds of inactivity. Restore the 15 ms audio link before starting capture after a slow connection. After 15 minutes idle on battery, enter deep sleep. A function key wakes the device and starts BLE reconnection.
diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md
index cbd78c9..44b7290 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.zh_CN.md
@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@

 ## Unreleased

+- PassVoice 可启用仅由 UP 控制采集的按键模式。采集中按下 DOWN 或 OK 会被忽略，即使结束采集后才松手；UP 结束采集后可立即触发新的按压，如果结束通知仍在发送，则附带已停止的会话 ID。其它主机的按键行为保持不变。
+
 - 接受 CW2017 的首次电量读数前先检查电芯电压。若电量计同时返回 0% 和无效电压，界面会显示读数暂不可用，等电量计恢复后再显示百分比。

 - 空闲 20 秒后请求 90–120 毫秒的 BLE 连接间隔。从低频连接开始录音前，先恢复 15 毫秒的音频连接。电池供电时空闲 15 分钟后进入深睡，短按功能键唤醒并重新连接蓝牙。
diff --git a/docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.md b/docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.md
index 065eb89..51271aa 100644
--- a/docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.md
+++ b/docs/ai-passport-ble-protocol.md
@@ -50,6 +50,7 @@ Host-to-device messages are:

 ```json
 {"v":1,"type":"host_ready"}
+{"v":1,"type":"host_ready","host":"passvoice"}
 {"v":1,"type":"host_state","state":"processing"}
 ```

@@ -77,6 +78,17 @@ an `OK` long press at 650 ms.

 Short clicks are emitted on debounced key release, without waiting for the driver's 180 ms double-click window. Rapid consecutive taps are separate actions. Delayed single/double-click callbacks are ignored by Vokie. OK uses an independent 650 ms hold timer, including when held immediately after a short tap; releasing after a long action does not also delete a character. Presses that started before the host handshake or on another connection do not produce an action.

+A host can opt in to the PassVoice button policy for its connection by
+sending `"host":"passvoice"` in `host_ready`. Only an `UP` click can end
+capture in this mode. `DOWN` and `OK` gestures that begin or trigger during
+capture are suppressed. A fresh press can trigger immediately after `UP`
+requests the stop. If the worker has not finished sending `ptt_up`, that
+`button_event` includes an optional `sessionId` for the stopped capture. The
+notification may arrive before `ptt_down` or `ptt_up`; the host uses the
+session ID to wait for a matching normal stop before acting on a deferred
+Return. Older firmware ignores the optional `host` field. Hosts that omit it
+or send another value retain the mapping above.
+
 ## Audio fragment envelope

 Every Audio notification contains one complete fragment. Multi-fragment frames
